{"seq":3,"slug":"snapshot-vs-event","title":"快照与事件溯源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-load-serialization/foundations/snapshot-vs-event","wordCount":1303,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"快照与事件溯源\">快照与事件溯源</h1><p>同一个存档需求，有两条根本不同的实现哲学。一条是拍一张世界的<strong>快照</strong>：把此刻所有状态原样冻结。另一条是记一本<strong>事件账本</strong>：不存世界长什么样，只存「导致它变成这样的一连串事件」，读档时从头重放。这不是细节之争，而是决定序列化机制、存档体积、版本迁移乃至反作弊策略的分水岭。这一篇讲清这条分叉，以及它们的混合与增量形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-状态导向-vs-变化导向\">核心概念：状态导向 vs 变化导向</h2><p>快照是<strong>状态导向</strong>：存档 = 世界当前状态的完整拷贝，读档 = 用这份拷贝覆盖世界。直观、加载快、与运行时结构耦合紧。</p>\n<p>事件溯源是<strong>变化导向</strong>：存档 = 从初始状态开始的有序事件日志（「玩家在 t1 拾取剑」「t2 击杀 Boss」），世界当前状态是重放这些事件的结果，而非被直接存储。当前状态是一个可推导的投影：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_n = f(S_0, e_1, e_2, \\dots, e_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 快照&#10;    A[世界状态] --&gt;|序列化| B[存档文件]&#10;    B --&gt;|反序列化| C[覆盖世界状态]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 事件溯源&#10;    D[初始状态 S0] --&gt; E[事件日志&lt;br/&gt;e1 e2 ... en]&#10;    E --&gt;|重放| F[重建当前状态 Sn]&#10;    F -.可选.-&gt; G[定期快照 = 检查点]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 快照\n    A[世界状态] --&gt;|序列化| B[存档文件]\n    B --&gt;|反序列化| C[覆盖世界状态]\n    end\n    subgraph 事件溯源\n    D[初始状态 S0] --&gt; E[事件日志&lt;br/&gt;e1 e2 ... en]\n    E --&gt;|重放| F[重建当前状态 Sn]\n    F -.可选.-&gt; G[定期快照 = 检查点]\n    end</pre><p>两者不是对立的教条：几乎所有认真做的系统最终都是某种混合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"各自的适用面与代价\">各自的适用面与代价</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>快照</th>\n<th>事件溯源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>读档速度</td>\n<td>快，直接还原</td>\n<td>慢，需重放（可用快照加速）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存档体积</td>\n<td>与世界规模成正比</td>\n<td>与事件数量成正比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审计/回放</td>\n<td>无历史，只有当前</td>\n<td>天然完整历史，可回放、可撤销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本迁移</td>\n<td>迁移一份状态结构</td>\n<td>需迁移每种事件的结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与运行时耦合</td>\n<td>紧，改状态结构即改存档</td>\n<td>松，事件是稳定的领域语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>单机开放世界、主机认证</td>\n<td>联机对战、经济系统、需防作弊/审计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>快照的痛点是与内部结构强耦合：改一个组件字段，老快照就可能读不回来，这把压力全压给 <a href=\"../versioning/backward-compatibility\">向后兼容</a> 与 <a href=\"../versioning/save-migration\">存档迁移</a>。事件溯源的痛点是重放成本与「事件也要版本化」——每种事件的模式同样会演化，见 <a href=\"../versioning/schema-evolution\">模式演化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"增量存档-介于两者之间\">增量存档：介于两者之间</h2><p>纯快照对开放世界太大，纯事件对单机太慢，于是有了<strong>增量/差异存档</strong>：以一个基线快照为底，之后只记录相对基线的改动（哪些箱子被开、哪些 NPC 死了）。它借用了事件溯源「只记变化」的思想，又保留了快照「有个可直接加载的底」的优点。</p>\n<p>实现上，增量需要一个<strong>脏标记</strong>机制：每个可持久对象带一个 dirty 位，只有被改动的对象才进入这次差异。读档时先加载基线，再依次应用各层差异。这与网络里的 delta 压缩是同源思想——只是那里的差异是逐帧发给客户端，见 <a href=\"../../game-networking/state-synchronization/delta-compression\">game-networking / delta 压缩</a>。增量把「摊平整张对象图」的成本摊到多次小写入上，但也让 <a href=\"../serialization/references-graphs\">引用与对象图</a> 的引用一致性问题更棘手：差异层里引用的对象，可能在基线里、也可能在另一层差异里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件溯源为何在联机与经济系统里胜出\">事件溯源为何在联机与经济系统里胜出</h2><p>对需要防作弊或审计的系统，事件溯源近乎必选。原因是它把「结果」换成了「原因」：服务器不信任客户端上报的最终金币数，而是记录并校验每一笔导致金币变化的事件。这天然抵抗篡改——改一个中间余额没用，因为余额是重放事件算出来的，而事件由服务器权威产生。这与 <a href=\"../practice/anti-tamper\">防篡改与校验</a> 和服务器权威架构直接相连。</p>\n<p>事件日志还带来「定期快照」这个经典优化：日志无限增长会让重放越来越慢，于是每隔 N 个事件就落一张快照当新起点，旧事件可归档。这正是快照与事件溯源在工程上的合流——快照成了事件流上的检查点。确定性重放（用输入日志精确重建世界）把这套思想推到极致，见 <a href=\"../../game-replay-determinism/replay-lockstep/input-replay-recording\">game-replay-determinism / 输入回放录制</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>快照存「世界现在是什么样」，事件溯源存「导致它变成这样的一串事件」，当前状态是重放事件的投影 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1..</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_n=f(S_0,e_{1..n})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1..</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>快照读档快、与运行时结构耦合紧、把压力压给版本迁移；事件溯源天然可审计防作弊，但重放慢、每种事件也要版本化。</li>\n<li>增量/差异存档借事件的「只记变化」思想 + 快照的「可直接加载的底」，靠脏标记实现，但加重了引用一致性负担。</li>\n<li>联机与经济系统偏向事件溯源，因为校验原因比信任结果更抗篡改；再用定期快照压住重放成本。</li>\n<li>实际系统几乎都是混合：快照做检查点，事件/差异记增量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"save-models\">存档模型</a> — 全状态与进度旗标如何对应两种哲学</li>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../versioning/save-migration\">存档迁移</a> — 快照迁移与事件迁移的不同压力</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-replay-determinism/replay-lockstep/input-replay-recording\">game-replay-determinism / 输入回放录制</a> — 事件重放的极致形态</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-networking/state-synchronization/delta-compression\">game-networking / delta 压缩</a> — 增量思想在网络同步中的对应</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"快照与事件溯源","id":"快照与事件溯源"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：状态导向 vs 变化导向","id":"核心概念-状态导向-vs-变化导向"},{"level":2,"text":"各自的适用面与代价","id":"各自的适用面与代价"},{"level":2,"text":"增量存档：介于两者之间","id":"增量存档-介于两者之间"},{"level":2,"text":"事件溯源为何在联机与经济系统里胜出","id":"事件溯源为何在联机与经济系统里胜出"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"存档模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-load-serialization/foundations/save-models"},"next":{"title":"序列化格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-save-load-serialization/serialization/save-formats"}}